            <h2 id="appendix-g">III. Appendix G — The Coupling Spectrum</h2>

            <p><em>(This appendix is the full mathematical destination for the forward-reference in <a href="/coupling-spectrum.html">Part V · Coupling</a>.)</em></p>

            <p>The coupling spectrum maps the behavior of a two-oscillator system under varying coupling strengths (<code>k</code>).</p>

            <p><strong>The Three Equations:</strong></p>

            <p><code>1.</code> <strong>Pre-Merger:</strong> <code>C + S = 1</code> (At Full Lock, k ≥ 1)</p>
            <p><code>2.</code> <strong>Post-Merger:</strong> <code>C + S + M = 1</code> (At Merger Lock, k = 10.2626)</p>
            <p><code>3.</code> <strong>The Sequence:</strong> <code>[\] → [/] → 🍳</code></p>

            <p><strong>The Empirical Data:</strong></p>

